# 🚀 Day 39 – PDF Splitter & Merger

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 39** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **📄 PDF Splitter & Merger**, a premium browser-based PDF utility that allows users to split and merge PDF documents entirely on the client side.

Unlike many online PDF tools, this application prioritizes **privacy, speed, and usability** by processing files locally in the browser without requiring uploads to external servers.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Create a modern PDF management application that provides a professional user experience while ensuring secure, offline document processing.

The application combines powerful PDF splitting and merging capabilities into a single responsive interface.

---

